  "description": "HUQCIH crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 6/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H148 Co4 Dy4 N12 O34,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Dy1C (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co1C (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Dy1F (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co1F (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Dy1I (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co1I (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.278-4.153 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.57-134.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C116H148Co4Dy4N12O34·2(C2H3N). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ2-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
